<section class="fpg-fo-sec" id="features"><div class="fpg-fo-wrap"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">How the TR6D 24 is built</h2><ul class="fpg-fo-feats" role="list">
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6t.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6t.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6t.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>FörstGrip feed rollers</h3><p>Twin hydraulic rollers. The top one lifts on an arc and is held down by two heavy springs, so it climbs over butt ends and drags in forks and awkward limbs.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Open-top flywheel</h3><p>A 640 × 25 mm flywheel with twin 8-inch blades throws the chip instead of blowing it, so wet, green material is far less likely to block the chute.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-kubota24t.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-kubota24t.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-kubota24t.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>24hp Kubota diesel</h3><p>The Stage V Kubota: the lighter and simpler of the two TR6D engines.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tracks6d.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tracks6d.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tracks6d.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Variable-width tracks</h3><p>Tracks in at 0.82 m for the garden gate, out at 1.2 m for stability on rough ground.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tracking.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tracking.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tracking.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>High-speed tracking</h3><p>Piggyback hydraulic pumps give fast tracking with the torque to climb.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-hopper.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-hopper.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-hopper.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Wide hopper</h3><p>Wide all the way down to the rollers, so forks and awkward limbs go in without trimming.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>AutoIntelligence control</h3><p>Sealed electronics that run the no-stress feed, tell you when a service is due and prompt the routine checks. Proof against water and vibration.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Quick to service</h3><p>Two catches and two bolts open the service access. One bolt releases the anvil.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30t.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30t.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30t.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Clear fuel tank</h3><p>A see-through 30-litre tank with a wide filler neck. You can read the level from across the yard.</p></div></li>
</ul></div></section>
